s=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use items when you're struggling with bank payments! Unexpected combos might occur!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/59df1ac89dd2b1d470cfc514dcd592f6.poster.avif?t=1755051607\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/59df1ac89dd2b1d470cfc514dcd592f6.webm?t=1755051607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2916670/extras/59df1ac89dd2b1d470cfc514dcd592f6.mp4?t=1755051607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Gameplay and Streaming Welcome</u></strong> <br><br>Monetization is also acceptable.</p>",
